1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,800
Life is 30,000 days.

4
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,600
Nothing more than 30,000 days
and nights passing by.

5
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,200
The brilliance when the future
and dreams overlap...

6
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,800
will become...

7
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,160
the most unforgettable,
moving moment.

8
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,160
For me,

9
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,960
that was...

10
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,640
the surge of excitement...

11
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,720
when I first soared into the sky.

12
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,600
(Episode 5:
She Who Soars Into the Sky)

13
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,280
Captain Yue, Captain Fan.
We'll head back first.

14
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,039
- Captain, we're heading back.
- Get some good rest.

15
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,279
- Okay.
- Captain Fan.

16
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,520
- Captain Yue.
- Thank you.

17
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:01,280
Ruan Si Xian.

18
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,480
- You're all here.
- Mr. Fu.

19
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,960
Did you come alone?

20
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,200
I came alone.

21
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,840
Perfect.

22
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,000
The inaugural flight is coming up,

23
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,280
so I came to check on you guys.

24
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,000
Then let me give you a report.

25
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,839
Regarding the pilots lately,

26
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,960
their results have been quite good.

27
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,640
Especially Xiao Ruan.

28
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,200
She just finished on the simulator.

29
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,440
She flew exceptionally well.

30
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,640
Is that so?

31
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,840
It seems you performed well.

32
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,160
That's commendable.

33
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,160
You seem to be
in a good mood, Mr. Fu.

34
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,520
I am.

35
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,440
I just completed
a very important task.

36
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,520
I'm in a wonderful mood.

37
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,360
My important task is flying planes.

38
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,559
How about this, Mr. Fu?

39
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,200
Come into the simulator with us...

40
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,440
and experience it.

41
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,799
I think Xiao Ruan's suggestion...

42
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,880
is quite excellent.

43
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,280
Mr. Fu, look.

44
00:03:58,281 --> 00:03:59,560
These simulators are new.

45
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,720
They're full-motion.

46
00:04:00,721 --> 00:04:01,799
The feeling once you're inside...

47
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,880
is exactly the same as real flying.

48
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,080
Give it a try.
That's right.

49
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,680
You can let Xiao Ruan
take you for a spin.

50
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,880
She's a very steady pilot.

51
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,240
Is that so?

52
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,560
No, it's fine.

53
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,159
See, before we bought them,

54
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,160
I already tried them out.

55
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,160
Yes, I've experienced it.

56
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,760
It's already lunchtime.

57
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,040
How about this?
Let's have lunch together.

58
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,960
Lunch? I think I'll pass.

59
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,559
Mr. Fu, your meals are too fancy.

60
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,680
I'm afraid I wouldn't fit in.

61
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,440
The inaugural flight is coming up.

62
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,320
I had better focus on my training.

63
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,319
- What about you two?
- We've already eaten.

64
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,400
You've eaten?

65
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,440
Mr. Fu, do you...

66
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,199
If you need Xiao Ruan for something,

67
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,919
we can actually
postpone the practice session.

68
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,119
- Right, Captain Fan?
- Either way is fine.

69
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,199
It's okay.

70
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,600
Training is more important.

71
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,040
After all, there will
be other chances.

72
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,000
What chances?

73
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,120
Just chances.

74
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,280
I'll let you get back to it.

75
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,880
Bai Yang.

76
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,720
Ms. Zheng,

77
00:05:41,721 --> 00:05:43,480
regarding what we discussed,
have you made a decision?

78
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,319
The shooting and post-production...

79
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,320
were meant to be
one complete design package.

80
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,800
You hired me to shoot,
but now you're hiring someone else
for post-production.

81
00:05:49,801 --> 00:05:51,599
- What's the meaning of this?
- Listen to me, Ms. Zheng.

82
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,800
I'm truly sorry.

83
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,080
But that is exactly what is
in the contract we signed.

84
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,839
Our company owns
the final right to modify...

85
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,080
and use all the filmed materials.

86
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,240
Fine. Whatever you say.

87
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,960
Anyway, I've never
seen anyone do things like this.

88
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,560
Just make sure
to pay the balance soon.

89
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,920
Hello?

90
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,720
Where are you?

91
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,360
This shoot...

92
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,840
was the most undignified one
I've ever done.

93
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,279
He treats me like a tool.

94
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,479
He uses me when he needs me,

95
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,079
and when he doesn't,
he just tosses me aside.

96
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,519
You know, when he was a kid,
he was actually quite cute.

97
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:32,040
How did he grow up
to be such a jerk?

98
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,600
That guy...

99
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,280
is just completely unreliable.

100
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,359
Not only is he unreliable,

101
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,399
he's also morally bankrupt
and devoid of humanity.

102
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,480
Only you...

103
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:43,080
would still have illusions
about him.

104
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,639
I say, if you're exercising,

105
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,280
can't you be more professional?

106
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:48,679
You've got that earpiece...

107
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,680
practically glued to your ear.

108
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,840
I was supposed
to have a meeting today.

109
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,039
But as soon as you called,
I came out to keep you company.

110
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,560
So now, I have
to attend the meeting online.

111
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,080
Well...

112
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,560
I'm sorry.

113
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:03,039
I always come to you
whenever something's on my mind.

114
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,800
I forgot that you're
a big-shot executive now.

115
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,080
Sorry for the interruption.

116
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:13,480
Speaking of interruptions,

117
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,080
it's really not one at all.

118
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,640
I've been wanting to vent
about Fu Ming Yu for a long time.

119
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,359
But Zhu Dong always switches sides.

120
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,479
Now that you're back,

121
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:23,839
you're like a godsend to me.

122
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:24,879
If you want to roast him
in the future,

123
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:25,880
I'm always game.

124
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,320
Always game, are you?

125
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,080
Well, then,

126
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,720
let's go to the wall.

127
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,719
You're too old
to play childish games.

128
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,800
It's always the wall with you.

129
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,480
Hurry up.

130
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,080
Why am I still following you around
like when we were kids?

131
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:53,960
(One Day Until Hengshi's
Z101 Inaugural Flight)

132
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:14,240
(One Day Until Hengshi's
Z101 Inaugural Flight)

133
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,280
I wish you
a successful first flight.

134
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,719
- Good luck, Captain Yue.
- Sir.

135
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,720
Hello.

136
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,280
Congratulations.
Hello, Captain Yue.

137
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,559
- Captain Fan.
- Sir.

138
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,119
I wish you
a successful first flight.

139
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:33,040
- May everything go smoothly.
- Don't worry, sir.

140
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,320
Xiao Ruan.

141
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,680
Captain Fan, I'm here.

142
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,680
- Time to go.
- Coming!

143
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,960
Ms. Ruan,

144
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,079
I think we should go...

145
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,440
for a drink tonight.

146
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:42,760
Mr. Yan, my first flight
is tomorrow.

147
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:43,880
How can I drink?

148
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,839
Right, no drinking.

149
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,840
Also,

150
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,800
don't pick me up
from work next time.

151
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,240
I don't want people
to get the wrong idea.

152
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,960
We should order a feast tomorrow...

153
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,840
to celebrate for Ruan Ruan.

154
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,040
I suggest coming to my place.

155
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,120
It's more convenient.

156
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:06,880
Sure.

157
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,640
Do you like this male star?

158
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,840
Do you know him too?

159
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,200
Of course I do.

160
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,200
He was super popular in high school.

161
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,560
That show they were in...
What was it called again?

162
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,760
"Tennis Boy".

163
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,800
"Tennis Boy".

164
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,959
Back then, the girls in class...

165
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,039
talked about them every single day.

166
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:27,040
- I got so sick of hearing it.
- Sick of it?

167
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,480
That's because you men don't get it.

168
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,040
You're the one who doesn't get it.

169
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,720
Back then,
we always heard girls say...

170
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,480
that Fu Ming Yu's vibe...

171
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,880
made him look
like that guy who played the lead.

172
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,440
Who?

173
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,600
He's called...

174
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,400
Xiao Xun Li.

175
00:10:43,401 --> 00:10:44,480
He's more like "Little Chestnut".

176
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,160
Xiao Xun Li, my foot.

177
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,240
Besides, his name is Xiao Li Xun.

178
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,880
"Little Chestnut" is a funny name.

179
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:54,880
How do they look alike?

180
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,000
They don't look alike at all, okay?

181
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,000
They were all blind.

182
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:05,880
What a coincidence.

183
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,840
Speak of "Little Chestnut",
and he appears.

184
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,160
What did you just say?

185
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,520
Nothing.

186
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,600
Do they look alike?

187
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,200
I don't think so.

188
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,480
Your features are
completely different.

189
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:36,160
But Mr. Yan was talking
about the vibe,

190
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,120
not the facial features.

191
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,400
Stop right there.
He doesn't compare.

192
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,400
Have you been drinking?

193
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,480
No.

194
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,720
Then why is your face so red?

195
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:52,760
If my face is red,

196
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,760
does it have to be from drinking?

197
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,399
What if I just came back
from clubbing and am still hyped up?

198
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:58,640
You have your first flight
tomorrow morning.

199
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,200
Drinking before a first flight
is a very serious matter.

200
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,080
You should know that very well.

201
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,000
I said I didn't drink.

202
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,800
Ruan Si Xian.

203
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,360
Boss, is something the matter?
First,

204
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,280
Yan An is backed by Bo'ao Airlines.

205
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,680
It's inappropriate for you
to be so close to him.

206
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,840
Mr. Fu,

207
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,199
are you stalking me?

208
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,200
Second,

209
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,160
Yan An is a playboy.

210
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,520
He changes girlfriends more often
than he changes his clothes.

211
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:28,840
Think about it carefully.

212
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,440
What about you, Mr. Fu?

213
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,440
Are you a playboy too?

214
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,840
Don't compare him to me.

215
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,839
Spain is great in every way,

216
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,960
except for the food.

217
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:51,400
Yue Yang,

218
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:55,400
were the expenses
for the trip to Spain quite high?

219
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:56,760
What's wrong?

220
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,560
I mean,

221
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,120
maybe we should just split the bill.

222
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,480
And what I mean is,

223
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,640
it's fine as long as you're happy.

224
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,119
Of course, if you want to thank me,

225
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,440
you can treat me
to a nice dinner tonight.

226
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:09,800
Is that all you want?

227
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,520
I haven't eaten well
these past few days either.

228
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,160
I'll look up some places.

229
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:20,399
(Top Rated List, Hot Pot)

230
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,840
(Jiang Zi Long: Send money.)

231
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,360
Send money!

232
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:29,280
If you don't, I'll go
to your office to find you.

233
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,200
Let's go.

234
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,800
Hey...

235
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,320
Why don't you go back first?

236
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:46,800
Why?

237
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:50,240
I just suddenly feel a bit tired.

238
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,320
Weren't you fine just now?

239
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,800
Besides, the one
who should be tired is me, right?

240
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,199
That's not what I meant.

241
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,200
Then what do you mean?

242
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,600
How about this?

243
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:03,960
Tomorrow,

244
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,400
I'll definitely take you...

245
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,760
to the best hot pot place.

246
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:08,880
Okay?

247
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,120
Fine.

248
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,400
Tomorrow?

249
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,840
- I'll get going then.
- Get some rest.

250
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:20,320
- I'll watch you go in.
- Let me know when you get home.

251
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:21,520
Okay.

252
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,600
I'm off.

253
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,720
Hello, Zi Yue.

254
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,520
You're his older sister.

255
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,920
You have to think
about your little brother.

256
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,839
He's your son,

257
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,039
not mine.

258
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,040
Why should I support him?

259
00:14:51,041 --> 00:14:52,680
You haven't sent
this month's money yet.

260
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,040
What do you mean I didn't send it?

261
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,319
I send it every month.

262
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,519
I've just been
a bit busy this month.

263
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,520
I forgot.

264
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,639
I have my own life to live too.

265
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,400
I have things
I need money for as well.

266
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,480
Zi Yue, I'm not in good health.

267
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:06,920
And your brother doesn't have a job.

268
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,479
- Think about our family.
- I think about you.

269
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:10,160
But who thinks about me?

270
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,920
Am I really
your biological daughter?

271
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,600
Jiang Zi Yue, you ungrateful brat!

272
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,880
You make 20,000 yuan
to 30,000 yuan a month.

273
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,239
If you don't give it to us,
who do you give it to?

274
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,800
I'm telling you, don't threaten me!

275
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,800
If you dare make a scene
at my company,

276
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,440
and I lose my job,

277
00:15:23,441 --> 00:15:24,600
the whole family will starve!

278
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:23,280
(The Day of
Hengshi's Z101 Inaugural Flight)

279
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,480
Ruan Ruan, congratulations
on your first flight!

280
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:44,680
Soar to the sky!

281
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,359
Congratulations, "Captain" Ruan!

282
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,959
Wishing you a safe first flight.

283
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,640
May everything go smoothly!

284
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,840
Morning, Mr. Yan.

285
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:12,280
You're here early.
Are you working at Hengshi?

286
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,200
You're working,

287
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,440
but I don't have to.

288
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,200
Keep up the hard work.

289
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,600
Morning, Mr. Fu.

290
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:29,000
What are you doing here so early?

291
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,680
What else could I be doing?

292
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,520
To pick up Ms. Ruan for work.

293
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:34,360
I don't mean to criticize,

294
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:36,160
but isn't Hengshi being too stingy?

295
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,800
You spent so much money
to poach this pilot,

296
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:39,880
yet you didn't even
arrange a car for her.

297
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,679
If she can't catch a taxi
in the morning,

298
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,680
what then?

299
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,080
You really don't need
to worry about that.

300
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,200
Mr. Fu.

301
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,640
Do you think...

302
00:17:51,641 --> 00:17:53,440
it would be inappropriate
for me to date...

303
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:56,360
one of your employees?

304
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:58,880
How about this?

305
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,120
Let's make a deal.

306
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,840
Your company has
so many talented people.

307
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,760
Why don't you...

308
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,000
let me have Ms. Ruan?

309
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,880
Is there even a spark yet?

310
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:12,920
More than just a spark.

311
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,760
The two of us...

312
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,680
hit it off like old friends.

313
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:17,760
Is that so?

314
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,520
Why do I feel
like she's more interested...

315
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,760
in me?

316
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:23,280
I'm more interested in you?

317
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,400
Mr. Fu,

318
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,560
you're really interesting.

319
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,520
No, I didn't mean it that way.

320
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:31,760
Now you're not interesting anymore.

321
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:35,800
Morning, Mr. Yan.

322
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:37,160
Morning.

323
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,440
How interesting.

324
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:44,080
Let me!

325
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,040
What does that mean?

326
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:48,520
Careful.

327
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,440
Fasten your seatbelt.

328
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:11,439
Although I don't know
what kind of history you have...

329
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,600
with Fu Ming Yu,

330
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,040
but today...

331
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,239
was the first time I've seen...

332
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,280
someone give him the cold shoulder.

333
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:18,120
My mood right now...

334
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:20,040
is absolutely fantastic.

335
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,960
What's your history with him?

336
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:24,080
We're competitors.

337
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:26,760
Our companies were once one.

338
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,439
And to this day, they maintain...

339
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,800
a non-zero-sum game model.

340
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:32,199
Competing and cooperating
with each other...

341
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,200
to achieve a win-win situation.

342
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,519
Everyone knows
that Hengshi's chairman...

343
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,599
and Bo'ao's chairman...

344
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:38,599
still meet up to play golf...

345
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:39,720
or have afternoon tea together.

346
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,960
Even Fu Ming Yu...

347
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,720
actually grew up with you.

348
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,760
Oh, you men and your words.

349
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:47,840
No wonder
you're the top female pilot.

350
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,360
You certainly know a lot.

351
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:51,360
As for me,

352
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:52,960
ever since I was a kid,

353
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,120
even though my grades
and daily performance...

354
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,600
were always
at the bottom of the class,

355
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:01,280
the old man at home
was just too strict.

356
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:04,240
I didn't dare to do
anything too out of line.

357
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:06,640
So much so that I've always felt...

358
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:08,920
I've failed to live up
to the title of "playboy".

359
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:11,120
But Fu Ming Yu,

360
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,439
ever since we were kids,

361
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,440
has never fit in with our group.

362
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,840
His face is so deceiving,

363
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,720
and his grades were excellent.

364
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,000
Teachers and students all liked him.

365
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,200
Isn't that infuriating?

366
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,320
And do you know
what the worst part was?

367
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:27,279
The goddess I had a crush on
for two years...

368
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,440
but never dared to confess to...

369
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:30,160
suddenly approached me one day.

370
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:33,120
I thought my chance
had finally come.

371
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:35,000
The two of us were
even close friends for a month.

372
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,279
In the end, she said to me,

373
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:38,400
"Yan An,"

374
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,960
"could you please introduce
Fu Ming Yu to me?"

375
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:44,080
I was absolutely livid.

376
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,560
So Ms. Ruan,

377
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,720
thank you.
Thank me for what?

378
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:51,880
I have finally had my day.

379
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:53,920
Thank you.

380
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,600
You've really made me look good.

381
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,720
Now, whenever I see you
in that uniform...

382
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:03,480
and think about
how you didn't join our airline,

383
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,120
I feel such deep regret.

384
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,520
Of course,
I'm a very generous person.

385
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:08,840
No matter where you work,

386
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,840
I sincerely wish you...

387
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,240
a bright future.

388
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,160
Thank you.

389
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:17,520
Why are you thanking me?

390
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,400
Once we get to the airport,

391
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:21,920
I have a surprise for you.

392
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:24,600
What surprise?

393
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:26,320
You'll see when we get there.

394
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:37,360
How is it?

395
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:38,920
Impressive, right?

396
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:56,120
(Revolution and Future)

397
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:07,320
(The Z101 Invites You to Traverse
the Mountains and Seas)

398
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:28,880
Mr. Yan, what brings you here?

399
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:32,440
If running alone in the dark
is too lonely,

400
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,280
then let's walk together.

401
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,440
Okay, see you later.

402
00:22:36,320 --> 00:22:37,320
Thank you.

403
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:41,320
You're welcome.

404
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,680
If you like it,

405
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:43,920
I can send one to you every day.

406
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,720
Did you hear?

407
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:50,880
The purser used
to fly international routes.

408
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,280
And she was only...

409
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:55,360
transferred here shortly before
the Z101's inaugural flight.

410
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:57,479
But I heard on the previous list,

411
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,599
the purser was supposed to be...

412
00:22:58,600 --> 00:22:59,720
Ms. Liu from Division One.

413
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:01,879
Based on domestic experience,

414
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,320
Ms. Liu is the most deserving.

415
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:05,520
Our job looks glamorous,

416
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,360
but actually,
there's radiation, noise,

417
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:10,520
and the torture of jet lag.

418
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:13,279
A mission like the inaugural flight
of a new aircraft model...

419
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:15,279
is significant for media exposure.

420
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:16,400
The cameras...

421
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:18,199
will take a few photos of you,

422
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,200
and you'll be in the news.

423
00:23:19,201 --> 00:23:21,200
It's the highlight of our careers.

424
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:22,840
How could Ms. Liu miss it?

425
00:23:23,360 --> 00:23:24,360
Isn't it a pity?

426
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:25,600
This is fate.

427
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,400
In terms of seniority,

428
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:28,680
what does my mentor lack?

429
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:30,600
Ms. Liu is well-deserving,

430
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:33,039
but she shouldn't have
gotten sick on duty.

431
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:34,840
My mentor was the one
who stepped up in a crisis.

432
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:37,079
You can feel sorry for Ms. Liu,

433
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:38,800
but don't go throwing mud at others.

434
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,240
What are you talking about?

435
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,080
Nothing.

436
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:45,480
Just some showbiz gossip.

437
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,240
What could they possibly have
to say that's worthwhile?

438
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,240
That's enough.

439
00:23:49,560 --> 00:23:51,800
This flight mission is very special.

440
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:53,760
The cabin isn't fully open
to the public.

441
00:23:54,120 --> 00:23:55,759
Most passengers are invited guests.

442
00:23:55,760 --> 00:23:57,080
Besides traditional media,

443
00:23:57,320 --> 00:23:59,480
there are also
some social media influencers.

444
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:00,600
Furthermore,

445
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:02,520
Mr. Fu of our group...

446
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:03,920
is also on this flight.

447
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,760
He's heading to Lincheng
on business.

448
00:24:06,280 --> 00:24:08,439
So, everyone, stay sharp.

449
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,440
Do you hear me?

450
00:24:09,441 --> 00:24:10,560
- Understood.
- Understood.

451
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:15,640
I'm Yue Yang,
the captain for this flight.

452
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:18,200
You should all be familiar
with Captain Fan Lei and me.

453
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,520
As for our other two colleagues,

454
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:20,560
please introduce yourselves.

455
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,560
I'm Lu Hua,
the co-pilot for this flight.

456
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,400
Hello, everyone.

457
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,200
I'm Ruan Si Xian, the trainee pilot.

458
00:24:27,520 --> 00:24:28,520
You know,

459
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,760
if you hadn't quit on impulse,

460
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:32,600
you would be a purser by now.

461
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:35,480
Maybe you would even be
in management.

462
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:38,360
Let's meet up sometime.

463
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,000
We have plenty of time.

464
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:47,880
Do you have a waitress
named Ruan Si Xian here?

465
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,400
Yes, why?

466
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:55,480
Is there something...

467
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:56,920
on my face?

468
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:58,840
No. I just think you're pretty.

469
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:02,480
All right. Lastly, let me
go over the points of attention.

470
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,520
First, there's media coverage today.

471
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,000
Let's all be prepared.

472
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:08,720
Second, it might be
a bit bumpy today.

473
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:11,480
The flight plan's
turbulence index is five.

474
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:13,439
When the time comes,
watch for the seatbelt sign...

475
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:14,479
as a prompt.

476
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:16,919
Also, in case of a fire
or other emergency,

477
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,360
security should act first,
then report.

478
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:19,520
That's all from me.

479
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,200
Purser?

480
00:25:27,440 --> 00:25:28,440
Are you not feeling well?

481
00:25:29,840 --> 00:25:32,320
No, I'm fine. Well,
I'll just say two quick things.

482
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:34,680
The cold-to-hot water ratio is
3 to 7.

483
00:25:34,760 --> 00:25:36,760
Watch the water temperature
to avoid scalding passengers.

484
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:39,399
Also, for those passengers
who change seats at will,

485
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,560
you must monitor them closely.

486
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:42,160
Avoid an unbalanced load.

487
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:44,680
Captain Yue, any other instructions?

488
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:45,800
No.

489
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,200
What about you guys?

490
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:51,040
Then I wish everyone all the best.

491
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,120
Have a great first flight.

492
00:25:53,120 --> 00:25:54,160
Okay, let's head over.

493
00:26:03,800 --> 00:26:05,320
Xiao Ruan!

494
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,600
Mr. Peng, this...

495
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:14,600
Don't get the wrong idea.
It's not from me.

496
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,599
Mr. Yan sent it to you.

497
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:17,799
I saw it sitting by the door,

498
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:18,880
so I brought it in for you.

499
00:26:20,600 --> 00:26:22,679
If you like it,
I can send one to you every day.

500
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:23,800
(Captain Ruan, wishing you
a successful first flight! Yan An)

501
00:26:24,760 --> 00:26:26,439
- Take it.
- Wait.

502
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:28,000
This morning, I thought it was
a flower basket or something.

503
00:26:28,320 --> 00:26:29,919
- This is...
- How do I hold this?

504
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:31,079
- It's really awkward to hold.
- It's too heavy.

505
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,840
It's really heavy.
Make sure you've got it.

506
00:26:33,560 --> 00:26:35,080
Support the bottom. Hold it. Okay.

507
00:26:35,840 --> 00:26:36,840
Don't move.

508
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,519
Xiao Ruan, don't move.

509
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:46,760
It's heavy.

510
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Gently.

511
00:26:48,280 --> 00:26:50,560
Here, let me. Okay.

512
00:26:51,520 --> 00:26:52,520
You can let go.

513
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:54,120
Just let go.

514
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:26,839
The Z101...

515
00:27:26,840 --> 00:27:28,719
is a mid-to-short-range
commercial airliner...

516
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:29,720
independently developed
by our country...

517
00:27:29,721 --> 00:27:31,040
according to international
standards.

518
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:32,320
As an aviation enthusiast,

519
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:34,240
being able to join
the Z101's first flight...

520
00:27:34,360 --> 00:27:35,360
is a very rare opportunity for me.

521
00:27:35,361 --> 00:27:36,479
Today, we will be taking...

522
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:39,400
Hengshi's Z101 flight to Lincheng.

523
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:41,719
In a moment, follow our crew...

524
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,760
to unveil the mystery of the Z101.

525
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:46,520
This trip is definitely worth it.

526
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:03,479
When Mr. Fu arrives,
and the news is released,

527
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:04,480
our former colleagues will all...

528
00:28:13,040 --> 00:28:14,040
- Mr. Fu.
- Mr. Fu.

529
00:28:14,600 --> 00:28:16,040
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.

530
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:21,480
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.
- Welcome aboard, Mr. Fu.

531
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:29,520
Thank you for your hard work.

532
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:45,280
Welcome aboard, little one.

533
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:47,239
- Little one, this is your seat.
- Okay.

534
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:49,160
- Call me if you have any problems.
- Thank you.

535
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,400
Mr. Bai.

536
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,720
Mr. Fu.

537
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:55,920
I have a very serious question
I want to ask you.

538
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,640
Go ahead.
Have you ever coaxed a woman?

539
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,000
W... What?

540
00:29:01,800 --> 00:29:02,880
Sir, let me show you to your seat.

541
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,400
Sir, your seat is here.

542
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:07,880
I said...

543
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:10,680
have you ever coaxed a woman?

544
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,000
W... What?
Could you speak up a bit?

545
00:29:15,760 --> 00:29:16,760
Check your phone.

546
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,520
"Have you ever coaxed a woman?"

547
00:29:30,360 --> 00:29:31,479
Hengshi 5253.

548
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:32,560
Requesting to enter the runway.

549
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:33,880
Hengshi 5253.

550
00:29:33,881 --> 00:29:35,160
You are cleared to enter Runway 04.

551
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:36,999
Cleared to enter Runway 04.

552
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,200
Hengshi 5253.

553
00:29:38,280 --> 00:29:39,760
Cleared to enter Runway 04.

554
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,960
- Confirmed.
- Lights on.

555
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:46,680
Before takeoff checklist.

556
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:48,040
Before takeoff checklist.

557
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:50,000
Takeoff runway.

558
00:29:50,120 --> 00:29:51,759
- Zero-four.
- Zero-four confirmed.

559
00:29:51,760 --> 00:29:52,760
TCAS.

560
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:54,200
TA only.

561
00:29:54,280 --> 00:29:56,040
TA/RA. Packs 1 and 2.

562
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:57,920
On.

563
00:29:57,921 --> 00:29:59,200
Before takeoff checklist complete.

564
00:30:00,760 --> 00:30:02,160
Final clear. Runway clear.

565
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:03,720
Check.

566
00:30:15,080 --> 00:30:16,120
Hengshi 5253.

567
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:17,160
Ready.

568
00:30:17,161 --> 00:30:18,839
03. Surface wind 100° at 2m/s.

569
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:20,400
Runway 04. Cleared for takeoff.

570
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:22,399
Zero-four, cleared for takeoff.

571
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,400
Hengshi 5253.

572
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:24,600
Takeoff clearance received.

573
00:30:25,080 --> 00:30:26,080
Confirmed.

574
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:29,440
Stable.

575
00:30:29,840 --> 00:30:30,840
Takeoff.

576
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:32,319
Manual thrust. Speed reference mode.

577
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:33,880
Runway, auto-thrust armed.

578
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:35,240
Check.

579
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:41,160
Thrust set.

580
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:43,200
- 100 knots.
- Check.

581
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,720
V1, rotate.

582
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,200
Positive rate.

583
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:53,200
Gear up.

584
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,120
Navigation.

585
00:30:59,320 --> 00:31:00,320
Check.

586
00:31:00,520 --> 00:31:01,520
Autopilot 1 on.

587
00:31:01,600 --> 00:31:02,600
Check.

588
00:31:04,360 --> 00:31:05,360
Flaps zero.

589
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:06,920
Speed checked, flaps zero.

590
00:31:38,040 --> 00:31:39,040
Here.

591
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,680
Nice.

592
00:31:46,560 --> 00:31:48,000
Come on, guys, look.

593
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:51,759
Cover for me.
I'm going to the lavatory.

594
00:31:51,760 --> 00:31:52,760
Okay, I got it.

595
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,240
Mr. Fu.
Hello, Mr. Fu.

596
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,200
What now?

597
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:35,480
Come out first.

598
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:37,200
Mr. Fu.

599
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:38,880
Why the rush?

600
00:32:39,080 --> 00:32:40,080
Is your health okay?

601
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:45,480
Stay safe. Careful!

602
00:32:53,320 --> 00:32:54,840
Hurry up and go. I have to go back.

603
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,800
Actually, what I want to say is...

604
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:04,800
I'm sorry.

605
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:14,360
Mr. Fu,

606
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:15,400
I still suggest you...
use the lavatory quickly.

607
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:19,080
Because there will
be turbulence soon.

608
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:21,000
The lavatory might be closed.

609
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,960
Also, stay safe.

610
00:33:36,040 --> 00:33:37,040
She's impossible to appease.

611
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,160
Mr. Fu.

612
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:07,280
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

613
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,800
Let me say a few words first.

614
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:14,159
- That was satisfying.
- Go on.

615
00:34:14,160 --> 00:34:16,119
When Ruan Ruan left Hengshi,

616
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:17,600
everyone was gossiping about her.

617
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:19,600
I was so angry
that I wanted to fight them.

618
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,080
But look at her now.

619
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,759
All of Hengshi is covered...

620
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:24,400
with photos of our "Captain" Ruan.

621
00:34:24,720 --> 00:34:25,720
This is what you call...

622
00:34:26,160 --> 00:34:27,400
the return of the queen.

623
00:34:27,520 --> 00:34:28,840
It's so gratifying. Speech over.

624
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:31,160
All right, let's eat.

625
00:34:31,240 --> 00:34:32,240
The meat is getting overcooked.

626
00:34:36,680 --> 00:34:39,040
Today is
our superstar's first flight.

627
00:34:39,280 --> 00:34:40,440
Why are you so calm?

628
00:34:40,680 --> 00:34:41,680
Yeah.

629
00:34:41,720 --> 00:34:43,879
Three generations of female pilots
in one frame today.

630
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,960
The news is trending
on social media.

631
00:34:46,200 --> 00:34:47,640
And the whole airport...

632
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:49,440
is filled with Ruan Ruan's photos!

633
00:34:50,200 --> 00:34:51,200
Aren't you happy?

634
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:58,120
Or did something bad happen
to you today?

635
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,880
I'm not unhappy.

636
00:35:02,840 --> 00:35:03,840
I just feel...

637
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,480
like my wish has finally come true.

638
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:07,640
Is that the face of someone
whose wish has come true?

639
00:35:07,840 --> 00:35:09,320
Why don't you
take a look in the mirror?

640
00:35:10,960 --> 00:35:12,280
To be honest,

641
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:13,800
I've imagined this countless times.

642
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:15,800
I thought today...

643
00:35:16,520 --> 00:35:18,200
would be the most memorable...

644
00:35:18,640 --> 00:35:19,640
and most exciting day...

645
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:21,000
of my life.

646
00:35:21,520 --> 00:35:22,520
But when I...

647
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:23,719
actually sat in the back seat...

648
00:35:23,720 --> 00:35:24,720
as an observer,

649
00:35:25,640 --> 00:35:26,640
I realized...

650
00:35:27,240 --> 00:35:28,320
that I've become greedier.

651
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:29,960
I keep wondering...

652
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:31,480
when I'll finally...

653
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:33,440
become a real co-pilot...

654
00:35:33,640 --> 00:35:34,640
or a real captain.

655
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,560
I want to dream bigger and bigger.

656
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,520
Am I...

657
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:42,080
being too greedy?

658
00:35:42,600 --> 00:35:44,040
How is that being greedy?

659
00:35:44,640 --> 00:35:46,400
Dreams should be big.

660
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:48,880
Who says women can't be ambitious?

661
00:35:49,080 --> 00:35:51,000
Ambition is the only way
to live life to the fullest.

662
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:52,840
And with vigor.

663
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:54,960
Yes, Xuan is right.

664
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,599
A toast to you two.

665
00:36:01,600 --> 00:36:02,999
The two biggest shareholders...

666
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,360
in making my dream come true.

667
00:36:06,520 --> 00:36:07,600
If it weren't...

668
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:10,040
for your generosity, Xuan,

669
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,280
my dream...

670
00:36:12,640 --> 00:36:14,800
would've died before I could
get into the aviation academy.

671
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:18,480
And our head of logistics,
Xiao Zhen.

672
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,120
With your constant feeding,

673
00:36:21,120 --> 00:36:23,560
I didn't starve
before I could succeed.

674
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:26,920
In this world,

675
00:36:28,440 --> 00:36:29,560
I don't have much family.

676
00:36:30,520 --> 00:36:31,640
You guys...

677
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:33,920
are my strongest links...

678
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:35,960
to this world.

679
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:42,440
Hey, why are you being so formal?

680
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,880
Look at her, isn't she annoying?

681
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:46,560
Really annoying.

682
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:48,120
Being so sentimental.

683
00:36:48,800 --> 00:36:49,960
I'm telling you, I'm going to cry.

684
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:51,479
My makeup will be ruined.

685
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,840
You'll have to pay for it.

686
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:54,280
All right, come on.

687
00:36:54,480 --> 00:36:55,480
A toast to you two.

688
00:36:55,600 --> 00:36:56,600
No need.

689
00:36:56,680 --> 00:36:57,680
You're too kind.

690
00:36:58,160 --> 00:36:59,160
- A toast to you two!
- You're too kind.

691
00:36:59,320 --> 00:37:00,639
- You two...
- No need.

692
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:01,640
You're too kind.

693
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:03,959
You're both big bosses.
I'm not worthy!

694
00:37:03,960 --> 00:37:05,800
All right. Let's get up. Up you go.

695
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:08,440
Let me say a few words.

696
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,440
Today...

697
00:37:12,120 --> 00:37:13,200
is very special...

698
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:14,920
for us.

699
00:37:15,560 --> 00:37:16,560
The past...

700
00:37:17,040 --> 00:37:18,040
is the path we've walked.

701
00:37:18,640 --> 00:37:19,640
We won't forget it,

702
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:20,880
but we won't dwell on it either.

703
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:23,160
This glass...

704
00:37:23,640 --> 00:37:24,640
is to the future.

705
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:26,160
May the three of us...

706
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:27,680
have a bright future...

707
00:37:28,080 --> 00:37:29,520
and fulfill our dreams.

708
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:31,880
To a bright future...

709
00:37:32,040 --> 00:37:33,360
and fulfilling our dreams!

710
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:35,240
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

711
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,280
It's that new female pilot,

712
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,400
Ruan Si Xian.

713
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:18,800
Really?

714
00:38:19,160 --> 00:38:20,599
Then her resume...

715
00:38:20,600 --> 00:38:21,600
is quite impressive.

716
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:23,840
Ruan Si Xian didn't just
become impressive today.

717
00:38:24,120 --> 00:38:25,599
When she was a flight attendant,

718
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:26,640
she was outstanding too.

719
00:38:27,080 --> 00:38:28,080
If she hadn't left,

720
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,680
she would have been a purser by now.

721
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:31,640
Then I don't understand.

722
00:38:31,680 --> 00:38:32,840
Why did she return to Hengshi Air?

723
00:38:33,240 --> 00:38:34,919
I heard many airlines...

724
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:35,920
were trying to recruit her.

725
00:38:36,040 --> 00:38:37,040
Exactly.

726
00:38:37,120 --> 00:38:38,680
And I've heard...

727
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:39,920
about those things in her past.

728
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:41,760
Doesn't she feel embarrassed?

729
00:38:42,120 --> 00:38:43,320
Could it be...

730
00:38:43,720 --> 00:38:46,240
she still has feelings for Mr. Fu?

731
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,760
If you put it that way,

732
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:49,800
everything makes sense!

733
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,200
What makes sense?

734
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:53,639
When we're talking
about outstanding women,

735
00:38:53,640 --> 00:38:55,960
can we not bring up
this baseless gossip?

736
00:38:56,200 --> 00:38:57,200
I think...

737
00:38:57,201 --> 00:38:58,840
there's no smoke without fire.

738
00:38:59,200 --> 00:39:00,320
Since it's being spread...

739
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,640
with so many details,

740
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:03,320
it's basically true.

741
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:04,919
Then how can you be sure...

742
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:06,439
the people spreading these rumors...

743
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,800
don't have ulterior motives?

744
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:09,080
If you don't want people to know,

745
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,520
don't do it in the first place.

746
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,000
Exactly.

747
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:13,120
If you're so curious,

748
00:39:13,520 --> 00:39:14,560
why don't you ask me to my face?

749
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:17,280
I'm an open book.

750
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:18,800
As long as you ask,

751
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,040
I'll tell you everything.

752
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,440
As for why I returned to Hengshi,

753
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:26,200
Mr. Fu's office...

754
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:28,120
is always open for you...

755
00:39:28,200 --> 00:39:29,200
to ask him yourself.

756
00:39:50,680 --> 00:39:51,680
Mr. Fu,

757
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:52,800
are we going back
to Huguang Residence?

758
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:55,800
What time is it?

759
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,000
It's 9:15pm.

760
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:00,120
Let's go to Mingchen.

761
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:03,799
By the way,
during the meeting this morning,

762
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,800
your phone was off.

763
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:06,520
Your mother called.

764
00:40:07,600 --> 00:40:09,000
She said you haven't
been home for a long time.

765
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:10,640
It's too late today.

766
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:11,800
Maybe tomorrow.

767
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:13,040
Okay.

768
00:40:27,240 --> 00:40:28,240
Stop here.

769
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:34,880
Bai Yang.

770
00:40:34,920 --> 00:40:36,120
Help me take the luggage up
in a bit.

771
00:40:36,600 --> 00:40:37,600
Sure thing.

772
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,920
Just got off the plane?

773
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:11,320
Is there even a spark yet?

774
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:13,000
More than just a spark.

775
00:41:13,520 --> 00:41:14,520
Is that so?

776
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:16,320
Why do I feel
like she's more interested...

777
00:41:16,520 --> 00:41:17,520
in me?

778
00:41:18,240 --> 00:41:19,360
Could it be...

779
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:22,320
that she still has feelings
for Mr. Fu?

780
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:23,720
If you put it that way,

781
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:25,840
everything makes sense!

782
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:30,520
I finally saw today...

783
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:32,880
what it means when they say,
"Like master, like man."

784
00:41:33,640 --> 00:41:34,640
What do you mean?

785
00:41:40,240 --> 00:41:41,880
- Let me help you with that.
- I have hands.

786
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,000
Ruan Si...

787
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:07,280
I'm telling you,

788
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,480
if you touch me again,

789
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:09,800
even if you are my boss,

790
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,440
I'll report you
for sexual harassment.

791
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:13,360
Touch you?

792
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,760
Sexual harassment?

793
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:28,760
Ruan Si Xian,

794
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:30,160
what do I have to do...

795
00:42:31,560 --> 00:42:32,560
to make it up to you?

796
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,960
Are you finished?

797
00:42:35,120 --> 00:42:36,120
Then engrave those words...

798
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:37,280
on your forehead.

799
00:42:55,880 --> 00:42:56,880
We're going to Huguang.

800
00:42:57,240 --> 00:42:58,240
What?

801
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:01,600
We're going home.

802
00:43:17,520 --> 00:43:18,520
Let's go.

803
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:30,120
(Departing Ep. 5 for Ep. 6)
